>Nuevo</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez-Rodriguez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cytologically proved malignant pleural effusions</article-title><source>Chest</source><year>1998</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>1798</fpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Chest||114|1798||bib6|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>HW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ali</surname><given-names>SZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurman</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Shih</surname><given-names>IeM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection of allelic imbalance in ascitic supernatant by digital single nucleotide polymorphism analysis</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>2580</fpage><lpage>2585</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Clin Cancer Res||8|2580||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12171887</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Peier</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Stone</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Sandberg</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>FISH in the evaluation of pleural and ascitic fluid</article-title><source>Cancer Genet Cytogenet</source><year>1995</year><volume>84</volume><fpage>116</fpage><lpage>119</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Genet Cytogenet||84|116||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8536224</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-typ